            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The NHS is consistently failing to meet the standard that 95% of A&amp;E patients should be seen within four hours. This is not just an issue for emergency departments - it is a marker of unprecedented stress across the whole system of health and social care.</AbstractText>
